      key in the login Keychain - copy the private key into this repo's
      SPARKLE_PRIVATE_KEY GitHub Actions secret (used by the release
      workflow's appcast-signing step) and nowhere else.
    -->
    <key>SUPublicEDKey</key>
    <string>REPLACE_WITH_GENERATED_ED25519_PUBLIC_KEY</string>
